{"title":"Snowmen","slug":"Snowmen","hero":{"file":"Snowman_Transparent.webp","width":299,"height":360},"pageid":1970,"revid":11285,"timestamp":"2024-03-19T11:02:58Z","lastEditor":"Grape-wtf","categories":["Items","Event_Items"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay and Ferwater"},{"label":"Price","value":"~$3,499"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.45.0"},{"label":"title1","value":"Snowman"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"Build a frosty friend, won't you?\"</big></i>\n\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Snowman</b> <i>(snowmen?)</i> is an object introduced in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Update_Log%2FVersion_1.45.0/\">v1.45.0</a>. It can be used for decoration, however, the bottom is rounded, so it can be difficult to get it standing upright.\n</p>"}
